{"id":"3d748c1ba1b93208","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-nno-arithmetic.md","title":"Definition — 自然数对象上的加法与乘法递归","display":"Definition — 自然数对象上的加法与乘法递归","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-nno-arithmetic","aliases":["14-df-nno-arithmetic"],"display":"Definition — 自然数对象上的加法与乘法递归","depends_on":["[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]"],"source_location":"VI Exercise 1(ii), printed 343; DjVu 177","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-nno-arithmetic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-nno-arithmetic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 自然数对象上的加法与乘法递归"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6902dd0863cb754\" href=\"?note=c6902dd0863cb754\" title=\"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration\">14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI Exercise 1(ii), printed 343; DjVu 177"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；以下范畴及 Hom 集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span> 为自然数对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2:N\\times N\\to N\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2:N\\times N\\to N\\)</span> 为积投影，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_N:N\\to1\">\\(!_N:N\\to1\\)</span> 为唯一箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 为存在唯一性已经证明时使用的唯一描述算子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\quad a\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land a\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=s\\circ a.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\quad a\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land a\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=s\\circ a.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"+_N\\coloneqq\\iota a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\;\\left(a\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land a\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=s\\circ a\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[+_N\\coloneqq\\iota a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\;\\left(a\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land a\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=s\\circ a\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\quad m\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=z\\circ!_N\\land m\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=+_N\\circ\\langle m,\\pi_2\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\quad m\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=z\\circ!_N\\land m\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=+_N\\circ\\langle m,\\pi_2\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\times_N\\coloneqq\\iota m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\;\\left(m\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=z\\circ!_N\\land m\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=+_N\\circ\\langle m,\\pi_2\\rangle\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\times_N\\coloneqq\\iota m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\;\\left(m\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=z\\circ!_N\\land m\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=+_N\\circ\\langle m,\\pi_2\\rangle\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>加法使用参数迭代中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=Y=N\">\\(X=Y=N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=1_N\">\\(g=1_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=s\\pi_1\">\\(h=s\\pi_1\\)</span>，所以第一个唯一描述有存在唯一性。乘法再使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=z!_N\">\\(g=z!_N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h=+_N\">\\(h=+_N\\)</span>，得到第二个唯一描述。所列方向固定为对第一个输入递归：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0+x=x\">\\(0+x=x\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+1)+x=s(n+x)\">\\((n+1)+x=s(n+x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\times x=0\">\\(0\\times x=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n+1)\\times x=(n\\times x)+x\">\\((n+1)\\times x=(n\\times x)+x\\)</span>。这仅构造两条箭头及其递归刻画，未把交换律、分配律等尚未在本原子证明的结论藏入定义。</p>\n<p>原稿记录曾读取原书 VI 练习 1（印刷 343，DjVu 177）并目视核对原图；原书仅提出练习，以下是独立解答。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"c6902dd0863cb754","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-parameter-iteration]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2:N\\times N\\to N","display":false},{"tex":"!_N:N\\to1","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\quad a\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land a\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=s\\circ a.","display":true},{"tex":"+_N\\coloneqq\\iota a\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\;\\left(a\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land a\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=s\\circ a\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\exists!m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\quad m\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=z\\circ!_N\\land m\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=+_N\\circ\\langle m,\\pi_2\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\times_N\\coloneqq\\iota m\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N\\times N,N)\\;\\left(m\\circ\\langle z\\circ!_N,\\operatorname{id}_N\\rangle=z\\circ!_N\\land m\\circ(s\\times\\operatorname{id}_N)=+_N\\circ\\langle m,\\pi_2\\rangle\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"X=Y=N","display":false},{"tex":"g=1_N","display":false},{"tex":"h=s\\pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"g=z!_N","display":false},{"tex":"h=+_N","display":false},{"tex":"0+x=x","display":false},{"tex":"(n+1)+x=s(n+x)","display":false},{"tex":"0\\times x=0","display":false},{"tex":"(n+1)\\times x=(n\\times x)+x","display":false}],"bytes":2416,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-nno-arithmetic|df-261 — 自然数对象上的加法与乘法递归]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-nno-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-nno-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"d0faa5e1a984aebe","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，选定终对象、二元积及投影 $p_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to A$、$q_{A,B}:A\\times B\\to B$。$(N,z,s)$ 满足 [[14-df-natural-numbers-object]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}(N,z,s)$；$+_N,\\times_N:N\\times N\\to N$ 为 [[14-df-nno-arithmetic]] 在该零与后继结构上构造的两条箭头。所有以下带 $N$ 下标的构造同时依赖已经固定的 $\\mathcal E,z,s$ 及积选择。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-nno-arithmetic]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-158","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-nno-arithmetic|df-261 — 自然数对象上的加法与乘法递归]]"}],"outgoing":["c6902dd0863cb754"]}